{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11115221","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115221","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1111522101:1":{"text":"이야아... 플루스토, 정말 실망스럽기 짝이 없네.","source_cn":"哎呀呀……普鲁斯托，你这家伙太令我失望了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A66EA7FEB090EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111522102:1":{"text":"너 정도면 절대로 실수하지 않을 거라고 생각했거든.","source_cn":"我还以为凭你的力量，这次一定不会失手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49146C169885BDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111522103:1":{"text":"그런데 말이야, 그 녀석들은 대체 신한테서 어떤 힘을 받은 걸까?","source_cn":"不过话说回来，他们从神明那里得到的力量是什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B163D8804AC4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111522104:1":{"text":"악마에게 마지막 일격을 가할 수 있는 그 힘... 대체 뭘까?","source_cn":"那个能够给予恶魔最后一击的力量……究竟是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x331085D5535FF14B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111522105:1":{"text":"제대로 조사해 봐야겠어.","source_cn":"有必要好好调查一番。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC422BB9340A9653D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111522106:1":{"text":"아, 짜증 나. 머리 굴리는 건 내 적성에 안 맞는데. <style=\"highlight\">그분</style>은 항상 이렇게 성가신 심부름만 시킨다니까.","source_cn":"唉，真讨厌，我最不擅长动脑子了。<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E10FFA32A0FBA36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111522107:1":{"text":"됐다, 됐어... 노인네가 성깔 부리기 전에 좀 더 힘 내봐야지.","source_cn":"算了算了……为了不惹祂老人家生气，我就再努力一点吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x320A51FBD3872174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:11010116:0":{"text":"평온을 되찾은 석양의 신의 무덤에서 베릴이 소리 없이 나타났다.","source_cn":"恢复平静的残阳神墓穴中，贝利尔悄无声息地出现了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7E2BACDAA84B791","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贝利尔":{"text":"베릴","source":"贝利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}